msgid "\"{}\" brings nothing today"
msgstr "「{}」今天沒有帶來任何內容"

msgid "\"{}\" does not say how an account connects"
msgstr "「{}」沒有說明帳號如何連線"

msgid "\"{}\" does not work as an id: it is used as a folder name, so it goes in lowercase, with dots, dashes or digits, and no slashes and no double dots"
msgstr "「{}」不能作為 ID 使用：它會當成資料夾名稱，因此必須使用小寫、點、連字號或數字，且不能有斜線或連續兩點"

