msgstr "「{}」不是可以授與權限的範圍"

msgid "\"{}\" would not be given to Chilpa alone ({}); turn exclusive mode off to share it"
msgstr "「{}」不會只給 Chilpa 獨佔使用 ({})；請關閉獨佔模式以共享之"

msgid "\"{}\" would not be given to Chilpa alone; turn exclusive mode off to share it"
msgstr "「{}」不會只給 Chilpa 獨佔使用；請關閉獨佔模式以共享之"

