msgstr "-23 響度(LUFS) · 廣播（EBU R128）"

msgid "1 hr"
msgstr "1 小時"

msgid "1. Back up your current PipeWire/WirePlumber config"
msgstr "1. 備份您目前的 PipeWire/WirePlumber 設定"

msgid "1. Find your DAC under 'Audio > Sinks' and note its number"
msgstr "1. 在「音訊 > 接收端」中找到您的 DAC，並記下其編號"

msgid "1. Origin"
msgstr "1. 來源"

msgid "16 bit"
msgstr "16 位元"

msgid "2 hr"
msgstr "2 小時"

msgid "2. Destinations"
msgstr "2. 目標"

msgid "2. Run with that number to read the node.name"
msgstr "2. 使用該編號執行以讀取 node.name"

msgid "24 bit in 3 bytes"
msgstr "24 位元（包裝在 3 位元組）"

msgid "24 bit in 32"
msgstr "24 位元（包裝在 32 位元中）"

msgid "3 hr"
msgstr "3 小時"

msgid "3. Restart the audio services to load the config"
msgstr "3. 重新啟動音訊系統服務以載入設定"

msgid "3. Review"
msgstr "3. 檢視"

msgid "30 min"
msgstr "30 分鐘"

msgid "32 bit"
msgstr "32 位元"

msgid "32 bit float"
msgstr "32 位元浮點數"

msgid "4. Summary"
msgstr "4. 摘要"

msgid "5 hr"
msgstr "5 小時"

msgid "A JACK graph runs at one rate and every program in it runs at that rate -- this one is at {} Hz. A track recorded at any other rate is resampled before Chilpa has any say, and no setting here changes it. JACK is for routing audio between programs; for a file delivered to a DAC untouched, choose the card itself."
msgstr "JACK 連線圖以單一取樣率運作，所有程式都必須使用該取樣率——目前為 {} Hz。以其它取樣率錄製的曲目會在 Chilpa 播放前被重新取樣，此處的設定無法改變此種行為。JACK 用於在程式間路由音訊；若要將檔案原樣傳送至 DAC，請直接選擇音效卡本身。"

msgid "A PCM carrier does not verify DoP. No tone or library track will play."
msgstr "PCM 載體不會驗證 DoP。任何測試音或音樂庫音軌都不會被播放。"

msgid "A Plex Media Server. You sign in with your Plex account, with a code at plex.tv/link."
msgstr "Plex 媒體伺服器。您可以透過在 plex.tv/link 輸入代碼並使用 Plex 帳號登入。"

msgid "A bar or OR: either is enough"
msgstr "使用 | 或 OR：符合其中一項即可"

msgid "A change to this playlist is still on its way to {}."
msgstr "此播放清單的變更仍在傳送至 {} 的途中。"

msgid "A chosen folder holds no songs"
msgstr "此資料夾沒有曲目"

msgid "A click on a record opens"
msgstr "點擊一筆錄音即可開啟"

msgid "A device operation is still running."
msgstr "裝置操作仍在進行中。"

msgid "A device selection can contain at most 50,000 files and playlists."
msgstr "裝置選取內容最多可包含 50,000 個檔案與播放清單。"

msgid "A folder chosen before"
msgstr "先前被選定的資料夾"

msgid "A media server on this network, such as MiniDLNA, Gerbera or the DLNA side of Plex. There is nothing to sign in to."
msgstr "此網路上的媒體伺服器，例如 MiniDLNA、Gerbera 或 Plex 的 DLNA 功能。無需登入。"

msgid "A media server you run yourself. You sign in with its user and password, or with Quick Connect."
msgstr "您自己維運的媒體伺服器。您可以使用其使用者名稱和密碼登錄，或使用快速連線登入。"

msgid "A name for this memory"
msgstr "此記憶的名稱"

msgid "A new version of Chilpa is available."
msgstr "Chilpa 有新版本可用。"

msgid "A player for your own music"
msgstr "專屬於你擁有的音樂的播放器"

msgid "A playlist member could not be resolved."
msgstr "無法解析播放清單中的成員。"

msgid "A profile already manages this device folder."
msgstr "已有設定檔管理此裝置資料夾。"

msgid "A receiver uses network playback. Its physical DAC is not exposed here."
msgstr "接收端使用網路播放。此處不會顯示其實體 DAC。"

msgid "A saved query already has that name."
msgstr "有同名的已儲存查詢。"

msgid "A saved query may use at most 16 KiB."
msgstr "已儲存的查詢最多可使用 16 KiB。"

msgid "A scan supports up to 256 folders and 64 KiB of saved paths."
msgstr "掃描最多支援 256 個資料夾與 64 KiB 的儲存路徑。"

msgid "A secure cast URL could not be created."
msgstr "無法建立安全的投射播放網址。"

msgid "A selected local file is unavailable. I kept the device unchanged."
msgstr "所選的本機檔案無法使用。已保持裝置不變。"

msgid "A selected playlist or one of its tracks is missing. I kept the device unchanged."
msgstr "所選的播放清單或其曲目遺失。已保持裝置不變。"

msgid "A selected queue is no longer available."
msgstr "所選的播放佇列已無法使用。"

msgid "A sidecar sets this, not the file"
msgstr "此設定由附屬檔案決定，而非檔案本身"

msgid "A sync operation still uses this profile."
msgstr "仍有同步操作正在使用此設定檔。"

msgid "A track counts once half of it has played, or four minutes. Listens made offline are sent later."
msgstr "曲目播放過半或達四分鐘即計為一次聆聽。離線時的聆聽紀錄會稍後傳送。"

