msgid "Chilpa"
msgstr "Chilpa"

msgid "Chilpa already pins rate, sink and exclusive mode at runtime. These files only change system-wide behavior — copy and run them yourself if you want them. Back up first."
msgstr "Chilpa 在執行時已固定取樣率、接收端與獨佔模式。這些檔案只會改變系統層級行為——如需使用請自行複製並執行。請先備份。"

msgid "Chilpa applies the processing shown below."
msgstr "Chilpa 會套用下方顯示的處理。"

msgid "Chilpa asks Plex for a code; on the next step you type it at plex.tv/link."
msgstr "Chilpa 會提供你一個代碼；接下來，請在 plex.tv/link 頁面輸入該代碼。"

msgid "Chilpa can also read the tempo, musical key and loudness of what this folder holds. It takes much longer than reading the folder: it starts when the scan is done, runs in the background, and can be stopped in Settings > Library > Analysis."
msgstr "Chilpa 也能讀取此資料夾內音樂的速度、調性與響度。這比單純讀取資料夾耗時得多：會在掃描完成後開始、在背景執行，並可於「設定 > 音樂庫 > 分析」中停止。"

msgid "Chilpa can run some plugins made for other platforms. Add a plugin catalog you use. Compatibility is not guaranteed; Chilpa is not responsible for these plugins' behavior."
msgstr "Chilpa 可執行部分為其他平台製作的外掛。請新增你使用的外掛目錄。相容性不保證；Chilpa 不對這些外掛的行為負責。"

msgid "Chilpa can see this machine's outputs but cannot play through them yet"
msgstr "Chilpa 可以看到此機器的輸出，但目前還無法透過它們播放"

msgid "Chilpa cannot read this link"
msgstr "Chilpa 無法讀取此連結"

msgid "Chilpa could not release the exclusive output. Stop playback and try the diagnosis again."
msgstr "Chilpa 無法釋放獨佔輸出。請停止播放後再試一次診斷。"

msgid "Chilpa does not send {} requests to a server"
msgstr "Chilpa 不能送 {} 到伺服器"

msgid "Chilpa is packaged as Flatpak/Snap and can't inspect your host audio stack. If playback already works, you're set. Pick your distribution and init system below for the right setup commands."
msgstr "Chilpa 以 Flatpak/Snap 包裝，無法檢查主機音訊堆疊。若播放已正常運作，就無需額外設定。請在下方選擇發行版與 init 系統以取得正確的設定指令。"

msgid "Chilpa is up to date."
msgstr "Chilpa 已是最新版本。"

msgid "Chilpa lyrics API"
msgstr "Chilpa 歌詞 API"

msgid "Chilpa never writes these files"
msgstr "Chilpa 不會寫入這些檔案"

msgid "Chilpa opens with the tabs it had when it closed."
msgstr "Chilpa 會以關閉前的分頁狀態重新開啟。"

msgid "Chilpa output"
msgstr "Chilpa 輸出"

msgid "Chilpa plays the files on your disks and the servers you run, and plugins add more sources. It tells you plainly whether what reaches your DAC is bit-perfect."
msgstr "Chilpa 播放你磁碟上的檔案與自架伺服器的音樂，外掛可新增更多來源。它會清楚告知送到 DAC 的內容是否為位元完美。"

msgid "Chilpa plugins"
msgstr "Chilpa 外掛"

msgid "Chilpa proxy"
msgstr "Chilpa 代理"

msgid "Chilpa reads its music now and lists it with yours as it arrives, with its playlists. Nothing on the server changes unless you change one of its playlists."
msgstr "Chilpa 正在讀取其音樂，並在讀取完成時連同其播放清單一起與您的音樂一同列出。除非您修改伺服器上的播放清單，否則伺服器上的內容不會改變。"

msgid "Chilpa reads its music now and lists it with yours as it arrives. Nothing on the server changes, and a DLNA / UPnP server has no playlists to bring."
msgstr "Chilpa 正在讀取其音樂，並在讀取完成時與您的音樂一同列出。伺服器上的內容不會改變，且 DLNA 或 UPnP 伺服器不提供播放清單。"

msgid "Chilpa requesting {} · {}-bit"
msgstr "Chilpa 請求 {} · {} 位元"

msgid "Chilpa sends no telemetry. When enabled, artist and release searches make one-way requests to MusicBrainz for results. Turning it off disables MusicBrainz features in Artist Network."
msgstr "Chilpa 不傳送任何遙測資料。啟用後，演出者與發行搜尋會向 MusicBrainz 發送單向請求以取得結果。關閉後會停用演出者網路中的 MusicBrainz 功能。"

msgid "Chilpa sends the original audio to the receiver."
msgstr "Chilpa 會將原始音訊傳送至接收端。"

msgid "Chilpa sets the device to each track's rate. With exclusive mode on, the device is also Chilpa's alone while a track plays, so nothing else on the Mac can use it meanwhile. Turn exclusive mode off to share it; the Mac mixes in whatever else plays."
msgstr "Chilpa 會將裝置設定為每首曲目的取樣率。啟用獨佔模式時，播放期間裝置僅供 Chilpa 使用，Mac 上其他程式無法同時使用。關閉獨佔模式即可共享；Mac 會混入其他正在播放的音訊。"

msgid "Chilpa will make smaller covers and backgrounds again when needed."
msgstr "需要時 Chilpa 會重新產生較小的封面與背景。"

msgid "Chilpa {} is available"
msgstr "Chilpa {} 可用"

msgid "Chilpa {} is ready"
msgstr "Chilpa {} 已就緒"

msgid "Chilpa's icon on the panel: a click shows or hides the window, the middle button plays or pauses, the wheel moves the volume."
msgstr "面板上的 Chilpa 圖示：點擊可顯示或隱藏視窗，中鍵可播放或暫停，滾輪可調整音量。"

msgid "Chilpatl is Nahuatl for hornet. Chilpa is a music player for the desktop, where local files, self-hosted servers and plugins are all just sources."
msgstr "Chilpatl 在納瓦特爾語中意為黃蜂。Chilpa 是一款桌面音樂播放器，本機檔案、自架伺服器與外掛都只是來源。"

